---
import Signature from './Signature.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section section--alt">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="about__portrait">
      {/* A studio shot of her actually working would outperform this eventually —
          buyers connect with the maker mid-process. Good enough to launch on. */}
      <img
        src="/images/jennifer-mazer-headshot.jpg"
        alt="Jennifer Mazer, artist and party designer, smiling outdoors on a sunny day"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        width="768"
        height="1024"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="about__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2>Meet Jen</h2>

      {/* TODO — replace with Jen's real bio, in her own voice.
          200–300 words. Where she's from, how she started painting, what she's
          drawn to, and how the party work grew out of the art. This is the
          second-most-read section on any artist site after the gallery. */}
      <p>
        Jen designs parties the way she paints — one piece at a time, by hand,
        until the whole thing holds together. A hand-lettered banner for a baby
        shower. Unicorn cookies iced one by one. Cannoli and cream puffs for a
        table she also styled. She has never been able to design just one part
        of something.
      </p>
      <p>
        The painting came first and it still runs underneath everything else:
        citrus against deep navy, koi turning through blue water, a pumpkin
        ringed in sunflowers. Different subjects, same hand — and it's why her
        parties look like they were drawn rather than ordered.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every piece and every party is made by hand, one at a time, for the
        person who asked for it.
      </p>

      <Signature height="3.25rem" color="var(--navy)" class="about__sig" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about__portrait {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    background: var(--cream-deep);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }

  .about__portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about__sig {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .about__sig { color: var(--lemon) !important; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about__portrait { max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
